      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_32",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 40,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "ai_aggression",
            value: 0.7,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_33",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("To make ready for the journey, Gorlack cut loose every possible burden from his flight. The hulking armor of the clasher caste was forsaken. Provisions were halved."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_34",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Even then, half among the flight were unready to last such a journey. Those yet too young. Those with wounds still mending. To Karron’s bewilderment, Gorlack gifted her these— a flight of her own to lead."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_35",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("At earliest dawn the Flight of Gorlack lifted skyward..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_36",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Flying over land darkly striped by long shadows of craggy peaks, with the light of a warm new sun between..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_37",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Soaring over a sea bright as the sky above, the airy world far around suspending them under a midday sun..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_38",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Skimming just above the glassy moonlit ocean, their wingwakes rippling behind..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_39",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("So forth the journey persisted."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_40",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("To spot the petty shoals, Resha formed her gliders into a forward line spanning several horizons. Even so, the shoals nigh slipped past their north wing unnoticed. At long last, the flight set down on them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_41",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Gorlack,Nemas,Shussek,Poseira",
          },
